    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Demo / Search: <strong><u>Chamber X Demo</u></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chamber X is now available on mobile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 Android Version / Search: <strong><u>Chamber X Mobile</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;CHAMBER X&quot; is a gripping puzzle-based horror mystery game where every locked door holds a secret waiting to be uncovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate through eerie rooms and solve intricate puzzles, you'll uncover dark truths and hidden clues to escape an ever-tightening grip of danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out, and the only way to survive is to solve the riddles and escape before the walls close in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging puzzle-solving mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie environments that challenge your wits and bravery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, atmospheric horror and mystery elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden clues and unlock doors.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Demo / Search: <strong><u>Chamber X Demo</u></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chamber X is now available on mobile!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 Android Version / Search: <strong><u>Chamber X Mobile</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;CHAMBER X&quot; is a gripping puzzle-based horror mystery game where every locked door holds a secret waiting to be uncovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate through eerie rooms and solve intricate puzzles, you'll uncover dark truths and hidden clues to escape an ever-tightening grip of danger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out, and the only way to survive is to solve the riddles and escape before the walls close in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging puzzle-solving mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie environments that challenge your wits and bravery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, atmospheric horror and mystery elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden clues and unlock doors.</p>",
